      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BELARIUS.\nStand, stand! We have th’ advantage of the ground;\nThe lane is guarded; nothing routs us but\nThe villainy of our fears.",
