      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCIUS.\nAway, boy, from the troops, and save thyself;\nFor friends kill friends, and the disorder’s such\nAs war were hoodwink’d.",
